# lexicon.src - English labels pointing at concepts (Boston Crab house format).
#   label | pos | ^concept | feats (k=v;k=v)
# pos: act obj qual cond time tone negverb condword force subj filler
# A label may be several words; the longest label wins. The reader also
# tries simple endings (s es ed ing ies, doubled last letter) before a word
# is called unread. The first label listed for a concept+pos is the one the
# realiser says. Closed-class words (not, will, you, and, the, ...) come from
# the Librarian's grammar (LibrarianGrammar~installBuiltins), not from here.
#
